## 11. Monetization Hooks (Design Only)

No billing in MVP.

Design considerations:

* Rate-limit fit analyses per supplier
* Flag “premium insights” internally
* Prepare for supplier subscriptions

---

## 12. Non-Goals (Explicit)

The backend must not include:

* Payments
* Pricing logic
* Logistics tracking
* Compliance automation
* Messaging/chat
* Notifications

These are future layers.

---

